Summary of Changes:
- Removed Nutstore/坚果云-specific SSO (Single Sign-On) authentication
- Removed Nutstore-specific Delta API for incremental sync
- Made WebDAV server URL configurable (instead of hardcoded to Nutstore)
- Adapted for generic WebDAV servers (Seafile, NextCloud, etc.)
- Updated branding, i18n strings, and plugin metadata

The core sync engine, including the three-layer conflict resolution
(diff3 → diff-match-patch → mergeDigIn), is preserved from the original.
